      "content": "but there is no \"fight\" left. that's the thing. it's not even a struggle anymore, it's just... finished. like a book that's been closed and thrown away. how do you tell someone to \"take a step\" when the ground they were standing on doesn't even exist anymore? it feels like a joke.",
